\cf0\tab The IFREF directive assembles code contained with angle \tab brackets in a manner consistent with the IFNDEF, IFDEF, IFNZERO \tab and IFZERO directives.  The determinant is whether or not a \tab stated symbol exists in the symbol table.\par
