\ulnone\tab    \ul Equipment Corporation\ulnone\i0  (\i DEC\i0 ); however, all work on the \ul R-L\par
\ulnone\tab    \ul Monitor System\ulnone  was performed by students in the New York City\par
\tab    area (including the author of this document who added support\par
\tab    for FOCAL, 1969 just before the submission as DECUS 8-466).\par
\par
\tab b) While DEC was totally unaware of this situation, \i DIBOL-8\i0  (the\par
